Lily saw what happened. She was sad too. She wanted to help Ben. She looked around. She saw some ducks on the shore. They were swimming and quacking. They looked happy.
She ran to Ben and hugged him. She said, "Don't worry, Ben. We can fix your boat. We have some sticks and leaves. We can use them as hooks."
